  "fixture_rules": [
    "Each owner case starts from a fresh deep copy of canonical_full_record and receipts, except reads expressly share one reader. All keys not overridden retain the canonical values.",
    "Replicated batches receive distinct valid batch directory names and matching batch fields. Replicated rows receive distinct Story/test paths as specified and matching valid receipt IDs; duplicate_test_row_on_last_batch duplicates a selected test to check unique-key normalization.",
    "Capture replies are injected; capture_tests asserts exact sorted unique original paths and appMap null. Saved SHA overrides do not alter captured SHA.",
    "Missing-key mutations delete fields; explicit null retains the field. independent variants and row mutations run with separate readers.",
    "legacy_hints counts hints matching legacy_hint_fragments; do not assert the complete sentence. finite_warnings requires finite deduplicated strings, not a passing current result.",
    "All reader/standalone cases spy on forbidden effects, and product cases snapshot saved Runtime state around only the read operation."
  ],
